## How it was tested

On upstream `main` 829b9477d + this branch (dev build, Docker, upstream's `./gradlew`): `freshCache` + `mergePluginGamevals`, `buildCache` (packs `witchs_potion_vars.toml`), compile, `:content:quest:test` pass, `spotlessCheck` pass, `installDist`, and the server boots to "Server ready" (the startup check against the quest dbrow passes). `tools/scripts/fix_gameval_conflicts.py --check`: no conflicts.

Not yet checked in game from this exact branch; an earlier version of the same script runs on our own test server.

No unit tests: the earlier version's dialogue tests needed a separate test fixture, and as with #366 they are left out. The one item move, the hand-in, is a single `invTransaction` deleting exactly one of each ingredient.

